 "origem": "gringa: Holanda (holandês): ~26% do país abaixo do nível do mar, diques, pôlderes com bombas, falha por 'piping' (sand boils) https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flood_control_in_the_Netherlands",
 "titulo": "You built a dike like the Dutch 🌷 #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "YOU BUILT A DIKE",
 "descripcion": "How the Netherlands keeps a quarter of the country dry below sea level: dikes, pumps, sand boils and steel walls, one problem at a time.\n\nWhat should we build next?\n\n#engineering #netherlands #flood #dike #shorts",
